     1,
     "Hi Hen-Chao,<div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># title: write.table command</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># date: 2013.7.24</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">x &lt;- c(1:10)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">y &lt;- rnorm(10)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">hp &lt;- data.frame(x, y)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">write.table(hp, file=&quot;hptest1.NA.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;,&quot;, col.names=NA)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">write.table(hp, file=&quot;hptest1.TRUE.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;,&quot;, col.names=TRUE)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">write.table(hp, file=&quot;hptest1.FALSE.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;,&quot;, col.names=FALSE)</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"># end</font></b></div><div><b><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></b></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-3SCF_nLUCu8/Ue8zHgMKaGI/AAAAAAAAAYE/nyAIp7wEghQ/s1600/hptest1.NA.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-3SCF_nLUCu8/Ue8zHgMKaGI/AAAAAAAAAYE/nyAIp7wEghQ/s1600/hptest1.NA.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238812724000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XglblOWDoujKu3NZkEGVZ\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-3SCF_nLUCu8/Ue8zHgMKaGI/AAAAAAAAAYE/nyAIp7wEghQ/s1600/hptest1.NA.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nqUzk8Pta4/Ue8zLchqIII/AAAAAAAAAYM/JQIfURiEE4A/s1600/hptest1.TRUE.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nqUzk8Pta4/Ue8zLchqIII/AAAAAAAAAYM/JQIfURiEE4A/s1600/hptest1.TRUE.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238812724000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36KwKN1vFCfiPq5Ow5alQB\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_nqUzk8Pta4/Ue8zLchqIII/AAAAAAAAAYM/JQIfURiEE4A/s1600/hptest1.TRUE.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Wk2MfbT3WKg/Ue8zOyKpvvI/AAAAAAAAAYU/Y5Xil4BP00g/s1600/hptest1.FALSE.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Wk2MfbT3WKg/Ue8zOyKpvvI/AAAAAAAAAYU/Y5Xil4BP00g/s1600/hptest1.FALSE.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238812724000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3n6mDQIrSkTYaZL-Hq5i-4\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-Wk2MfbT3WKg/Ue8zOyKpvvI/AAAAAAAAAYU/Y5Xil4BP00g/s1600/hptest1.FALSE.jpg\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">從上圖可知:</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">1. col.names=NA 仍會輸出</font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">欄名稱</span><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">, 且因預設值 row.names = TRUE, 因此第A1儲存格會有空白.</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">2. col.names=TRUE 將輸出</font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">欄名稱</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">, 但因A1位址沒有多一個空白, 因此欄位名稱對應似乎有錯誤.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">3. </span><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">col.names=FALSE 其結果完全沒有輸出欄名稱.</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">4. 一般資料匯出時如果不考慮列名稱, 應可採用以下方式:</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>write.table(hp, file=&quot;hptest1.csv&quot;, sep=&quot;,&quot;, <font color=\"#ff0000\">row.names=FALSE</font>)</b></font><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># end</b></font></div><br>Hen-Chao Chang於 2013年7月22日星期一UTC+8下午2時40分19秒寫道：</div>"
